</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T10.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T10.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A5.T10.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T10.2.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">My child has recently been unwell, with blisters and rashes on the body, and keeps complaining of throat discomfort. In addition, the child has a fever and keeps sneezing and having a runny nose. What could be wrong with my child? What is causing this? How should it be treated?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T10.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T10.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A5.T10.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T10.2.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.T10.2.7.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ground-Truth Diagnosis</span>:
<span id="A5.T10.2.7.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Hand, foot, and mouth disease</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
