<span id="A5.T11.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T11.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.T11.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Original</span>:</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T11.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T11.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A5.T11.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T11.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Recently, I have noticed that the bloodshot appearance in my eyes has become particularly obvious, especially in the past few days. Every morning when I wake up, there is much more eye discharge than usual, and my eyes also feel somewhat painful. What could be causing these symptoms in my eyes? Do I need to use medication or go to the hospital for further examination?</span>
</span></td></tr>
