<td id="A5.T11.2.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">
<span id="A5.T11.2.16.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T11.2.16.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.T11.2.16.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Qwen3-32B’s Diagnosis</span>:
<span id="A5.T11.2.16.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Acute dacryocystitis</span> <img src="2510.09275v1/src/sad.png" id="A5.T11.g4" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:14/14;" width="14" height="14" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span>
