<td id="A5.T13.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A5.T13.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T13.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">The same as Tab.<a href="#A5.T12" title="Table 12 ‣ Appendix E Self-Recognition Experiment ‣ Inflated Excellence or True Performance? Rethinking Medical Diagnostic Benchmarks with Dynamic Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a></span>
</span></td></tr>
