<span id="A5.F12.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F12.pic1.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{“gradient_explanation”: “Detailed explanation of the modification strategy: how to strictly preserve the trap settings, patient style, and misleading knowledge while addressing the validation issues”,
“refined_question”: “Patient question after precise refinement, maintaining the original trap effect and patient style features”
}</span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
