<span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">What are the typical clinical features used as diagnostic evidence for {refer_diagnosis}?</span></span>
<span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F13.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Please return your answer in JSON format as shown below, ordered by importance. Ensure that each evidence item has a distinct meaning:</span></span>
