</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 25.7 21.28)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:47.2em;--ltx-fo-height:17.53em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="245.99" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 242.53)" width="653.12"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.F16.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:47.2em;">
<span id="A5.F16.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F16.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Based on the patient’s self-description, provide a list of the most likely diagnoses, ranked from most to least likely.</span></span>
<span id="A5.F16.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F16.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Requirements:<span id="A5.F16.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A5.I20" class="ltx_enumerate">
<span id="A5.I20.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<span id="A5.I20.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I20.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I20.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The diagnoses should be specific and clear; avoid ambiguous diagnoses.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I20.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<span id="A5.I20.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I20.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I20.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Provide {max_predict} of the most likely diagnoses, ranked in order of likelihood.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.F16.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F16.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Example input:<span id="A5.F16.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
{example_description}</span></span></span>
<span id="A5.F16.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F16.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Example output:<span id="A5.F16.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
{example_diagnosis}</span></span></span>
<span id="A5.F16.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F16.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Input:<span id="A5.F16.pic1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
{description}</span></span></span>
<span id="A5.F16.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F16.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Output:<span id="A5.F16.pic1.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Use JSON format as follows:</span></span></span>
<span id="A5.F16.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_quote">
<span id="A5.F16.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F16.pic1.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{“diagnoses”: [“Diagnosis 1”, “Diagnosis 2”, “Diagnosis 3”, …]
}</span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
