<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 21: </span>Prompt for helpfulness. <span id="A5.F21.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">EvalMed</span> scores the accuracy along with helpfulness. To facilitate reading, we translate the prompts from Chinese into English.</figcaption>
</figure>
